        "text_jeNT6x": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Today’s tamper-evident labels help prevent incidents ranging from simple accidents to catastrophic tragedy. While most broken labels are likely the result of an accident, a broken tamper-evident label lets a consumer know that they should not risk using the product. Given this benefits to the consumer, more companies are starting to use tamper-evident labeling even when not required. It’s all part of protecting customers and creating a higher-quality buyer experience. </p><p>NADCO Tapes & Labels, Inc. specializes in customized orders for tamper-evident labels, as well as a variety of other labels and tapes. Our 35,000-square-foot warehouse allows us to keep a large inventory of the adhesive products you need most. </p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> for more information about our tamper-evident label solutions or any of our other products.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
